Further work needed: The source's mixed diagram has g smooth at y' while X'→X×_YY' is étale at x', with a germwise equivalence of the largest-open P loci. This requires a carefully typed comparison of the source and target localities in a noncartesian square; check the exact factorization and pointwise maps before promoting.

